      "control_name": "MFA Device Changes Must Be Monitored",
      "control_description": "A CloudWatch metric filter and alarm must monitor MFA device enrollment and deactivation events. MFA device changes (CreateVirtualMFADevice, EnableMFADevice, DeactivateMFADevice, DeleteVirtualMFADevice) are a persistence mechanism — an attacker who gains temporary access can enroll their own MFA device to maintain access after the victim resets their password.\n",
