      "remediation": {
        "description": "No metric filter or alarm is configured to monitor MFA device changes. Unauthorized MFA enrollment goes undetected.",
        "action": "Create a CloudWatch log metric filter on the CloudTrail log group matching CreateVirtualMFADevice, EnableMFADevice, DeactivateMFADevice, and DeleteVirtualMFADevice events. Create an alarm with an SNS notification action to alert on any MFA device change.",
        "example": "{\n  \"monitoring\": {\n    \"kind\": \"account\",\n    \"metric_filters\": {\n      \"mfa_device_changes\": {\n        \"exists\": true\n      }\n    },\n    \"alarms\": {\n      \"mfa_device_changes\": {\n        \"exists\": true,\n        \"sns_topic_arn\": \"arn:aws:sns:us-east-1:123456789012:security-alerts\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n"
